[{"type":"human","data":{"content":"Here is a summary of the conversation to date:\n\n1. 主要话题：国庆节（10月1日）期间的活动建议，聚焦于旅梦在南昌的本地化安排。  \n2. 重要事实：  \n　　- 用户姓名：旅梦  \n　　- 日期：今天是国庆节（即10月1日）  \n　　- 地点：南昌  \n　　- 偏好：明确选择“看升旗/烟花/红色主题展”  \n3. 关键上下文：旅梦身处南昌，倾向参与具有节日仪式感和地域特色（红色文化）的线下庆祝活动；此前AI已提供多类选项，用户从中定向选择了前三项。","id":"05dc00c4-e716-4b63-be84-9ac38cca086f","additional_kwargs":{"lc_source":"summarization"},"response_metadata":{}}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-16972ccf-d2ab-929a-b60c-bc6dfa2422d7","name":"model","content":"太棒了！南昌是英雄城，国庆氛围超浓～  \n📍推荐你：  \n- **八一广场**看升旗（早6:00左右，建议5:30前到）  \n- **滕王阁**或**秋水广场**赏烟花（往年有，可查南昌文旅局最新公告）  \n- **八一起义纪念馆**或**江西省博物馆新馆**（红色主题展丰富，免费需预约）  \n\n需要我帮你查今日升旗时间、烟花安排或预约链接吗？😊","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":187,"completionTokens":115,"totalTokens":302},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen-plus","usage":{"total_tokens":302,"completion_tokens":115,"prompt_tokens":187,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":115,"input_tokens":187,"total_tokens":302,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}},{"type":"human","data":{"content":"八一起义纪念馆有什么需要准备的吗","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"id":"84035417-26ec-4324-b77b-954a5dc02dc3"}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-a58510ca-8d04-952d-a428-ef8dd43e0ac8","name":"model","content":"去八一起义纪念馆，旅梦记得准备：  \n✅ **身份证**（必须刷证入场）  \n✅ **提前预约**：微信搜“八一起义纪念馆”公众号 → 预约参观（免费，每日限流）  \n✅ 穿舒适鞋（馆内展陈丰富，步行较多）  \n✅ 可带小本子或手机备忘——馆内有沉浸式场景和珍贵文物，值得记录  \n\n⚠️ 注意：馆内禁止闪光灯拍照，部分展区需保持安静。  \n\n需要我帮你生成预约步骤截图说明，或推荐馆内必看3个展项吗？😊","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":321,"completionTokens":134,"totalTokens":455},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen-plus","usage":{"total_tokens":455,"completion_tokens":134,"prompt_tokens":321,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":134,"input_tokens":321,"total_tokens":455,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}},{"type":"human","data":{"content":"好的,推荐吧","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"id":"f5027767-e649-4bc8-8c9b-3fde118233b9"}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-f6035c2e-dc6e-9251-961c-fd3c66f46a92","name":"model","content":"好的！旅梦，这是八一起义纪念馆「必看3大展项」（紧扣红色初心+沉浸体验）：\n\n1. **“第一枪”实景复原厅**  \n　→ 1927年8月1日凌晨的南昌城：声光再现起义前敌委员会会议、贺龙指挥部旧址场景，还能听到模拟枪声与电报声，代入感超强！\n\n2. **周恩来、朱德、贺龙等领导人手迹与文物展柜**  \n　→ 特别推荐看：周恩来佩戴过的怀表（起义当日计时用）、贺龙亲笔签署的委任状原件——历史就在眼前。\n\n3. **“从南昌出发”多媒体长廊**  \n　→ 动态地图展示起义部队南下路线，配合AR扫码，手机可“召唤”战士虚拟影像讲述故事，年轻人超爱！\n\n小贴士：馆内提供免费定时讲解（每天10:00/14:00两场），建议掐点去听～  \n需要我帮你查今天讲解场次是否开放，或生成预约+交通小指南吗？😊","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":474,"completionTokens":241,"totalTokens":715},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen-plus","usage":{"total_tokens":715,"completion_tokens":241,"prompt_tokens":474,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":241,"input_tokens":474,"total_tokens":715,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}},{"type":"human","data":{"content":"我要去哪个城市?","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"id":"752e095e-1134-4a01-bcf0-becb56c91365"}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-e7b8beda-b86d-9e64-9f09-c4ddaee6fd4a","name":"model","content":"你就在**南昌**！  \n（国庆节当天，你在南昌，准备去八一起义纪念馆等红色景点～）","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":730,"completionTokens":26,"totalTokens":756},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen-plus","usage":{"total_tokens":756,"completion_tokens":26,"prompt_tokens":730,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":26,"input_tokens":730,"total_tokens":756,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}}]
